parameters.text:
=Generate a concise engineering incident postmortem using only the evidence below.

Title: {{ $('Prepare Incident').first().json.title }}
Service: {{ $('Prepare Incident').first().json.service }}
Severity: {{ $('Prepare Incident').first().json.severity }}
Initial Summary: {{ $('Prepare Incident').first().json.ai_summary }}
Initial Probable Cause: {{ $('Prepare Incident').first().json.probable_cause }}
Investigation: {{ $('AI Incident Investigator').first().json.output }}
GitHub Issue State: {{ $('GitHub — Check Issue').first().json.state }}
GitHub Closed At: {{ $('GitHub — Check Issue').first().json.closed_at || 'not provided' }}

The GitHub issue is closed.

Return:
1. Incident Summary
2. Impact
3. Root Cause / Best Supported Explanation
4. Investigation & Resolution
5. Preventive Actions
6. Lessons Learned

Do not invent facts. If the exact root cause or resolution steps are not present in the evidence, explicitly label them as unknown or a hypothesis.

